# Pixel Pantry

Flat icons live in `assets/flat/` (SVG + PNG). After editing SVGs, run `npm run icons:generate` to refresh `components/icons/`. Register new files in `lib/flatRegistry.tsx` and add name aliases in `lib/flatAssets.ts` if needed. Cook animation timing/layout: `components/cook/sceneLayout.ts`.

```bash
npm install
npx expo start --clear
```
